{
  "$comment": "Machine-readable half of app/PROTOCOL.md -- the clock <-> app BLE contract. PROTOCOL.md is normative for behaviour; this file is normative for numbers (UUIDs, offsets, enums, golden vector). The firmware test suite (firmware/test/host/test_net.cpp) asserts the golden vector against the shipping encoder.",
  "protocol_version": 1,
  "snapshot_schema": 1,

